 184: ## Module design
 185: 
 186: Two new fork-owned files (neither name exists upstream):
 187: 
 188: - `bin/lib/install-names.js`: the one names table. Four frozen arrays (Generated,
 189:   Legacy, Observed, Protected) plus `isProtectedName`. Requires nothing. Consumed by
 190:   `removeGsdFiles` (replacing the inline lists at 482-486 and 498-507) and by the
 191:   transaction, so cleanup never loads the transaction to read names.
 192: - `bin/lib/install-transaction.js`: requires `./install-names` and Node builtins only.
 193:   Direction is `install.js` -> transaction -> names; no cycle.
 194: 
 195: Injection: one factory `createInstallTransactionApi(ports)` merging over defaults. Not
 196: the `deps.fs || fs` idiom, since each `||` is a branch pair per port per function.
 197: Ports: `fs` (sync subset), `platform`, `now`, `pid`, `signalProcess`, `newId`,
 198: `freeBytes` (`fs.statfsSync`; Node floor is 20.9, no guard). `platform` is a port so
 199: the win32, darwin and linux folding branches are all coverable on any host, which a
 200: 100% gate on a 3-OS matrix requires. No logger port: the module returns outcomes and a
 201: pure `renderOutcome(outcome, notices)` returns `{ exitCode, lines }`; `install.js`
 202: prints. Message, code and bytes are then each assertable without console capture.
 203: 
 204: Exports: `acquireLock`, `inspectExisting`, `openTransaction`, `snapshotPathOf`,
 205: `recordExpectedWrite`, `markSpawning`, `recordChildPid`, `markChildClosed`,
 206: `planRollback`, `applyRollbackAction`, `verify`, `rollback`, `recover`, `retire`,
 207: `commit`, `renderOutcome`. The plan/apply split is an implementation choice, not the
 208: note's: it makes "wrapper killed mid-rollback after action k" deterministic for every
 209: k with no sleeps and no crash seam (step 8 catches per-entry errors and would swallow
 210: a thrown seam).
 211: 
 212: Stays in `bin/install.js`: argument parsing, `isSafeToClean`, `targetRelativePath`
 213: (gains the Protected refusal), `removeGsdFiles`, `detectV2`, `cleanupV2` (moved inside
 214: `install()` under `failWithRollback`), `patchStatusLine`, overlay copies,
 215: `preserveLocalPatchHistory` (reads `snapshotPathOf`), `install()` and its existing
 216: seams and result shape, `main()`, `uninstall()` (lock plus journal refusal only), the
 217: file header (F2), the misplaced JSDoc (F7).
